WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.621
Multiply each place of one number by the other. Add partial products and check the

00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:06.344
place-value columns.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:16.018
Work out 402 times 20 using an efficient method. The answer is 8040. 402 times 20

00:00:16.018 --> 00:00:17.120
equals 8040.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:24.061
A project in a recycling club has 801 units in each of 44 sets. What is the total?

00:00:24.061 --> 00:00:25.758
Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:36.800
A project in a recycling club has 801 units in each of 44 sets. What is the total?

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.891
The answer is 35244. 801 times 44 equals 35244.
